.refact/
*.orig

# Local runtime artefacts and env backups (added 2026-08-18)
# Every .env variant — backups, per-machine copies, whatever a future session
# names one. The narrow .env.backup-* rule this replaces only covered the one
# backup that existed when it was written, and a differently-named backup
# containing the same secrets slipped straight past it on 20 Aug.
.env.*
!.env.example
backend/server_out.txt
backend/server_err.txt
